          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your coral symbiotes have grown into your bloodstream and are now curled around your heart. When you would die, the coral in your body releases a burst of healing energy. This prevents you from dying and restores @Damage[4d8[healing]] Hit Points. Once this ability is used, the coral fades to a dull gray and gives you no benefits until you complete your next daily preparations.</p>"
          },
