          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] and a creature who hasn't detected you passes within 20 feet of you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Like the moray eels athamaru communities raise and train, you know how to quickly strike from hiding. Stride or Swim directly toward the triggering creature and make a melee Strike against it. The target creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to this attack.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> If you're mounted on an eel, you can have the eel move instead of yourself.</p>"
